{"id":"paket","lemma":"Paket","pos":"noun","rank":2464,"glosses":["packet, package, parcel (the term is almost exclusively used for packages sent by mail)","package, bundle (collective of different, often immaterial things)","data packet"],"ipa":"/paˈkeːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/De-Paket.ogg/De-Paket.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Paketes","plural":"Pakete"},"examples":[{"text":"Dieses Paket ist für Sie.","en":"This package is for you.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"she / they / you"}]},{"text":"Hast du mein Paket bekommen?","en":"Did you receive my package?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Ich lasse diese Pakete hier.","en":"I'll leave these packages here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Ich will ihm beim Tragen der Pakete helfen.","en":"I want to help him carry the packages.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"at the"},{"g":"to carry, to bear"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Öffne bitte das Paket!","en":"Please open the package.","words":[{"g":"to open","l":"öffnen"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"the / that"},null]}]}